    "body": "PathPilot Hub 2.14.4 (770MX SIM) refused `probe_face.nc` at `#190=#102-0.7874` with \"Bad character '-' used\": LinuxCNC evaluates arithmetic only inside brackets. Fixed in 6e246c8:\n- Each deviation is now `#n=[mean-expected]`.\n- The expected value's sign is folded into the operator, so edge and corner probes no longer write `#100--0.0787`.\n- Pinned by `assignments_are_bracketed` on every golden; the goldens are regenerated.\n\nHub testing continues.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
